{"id":"619955","name":"紫薯荷叶饼","author":"一溪月","authorId":"10449735","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/619955/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"紫薯","amount":"适量"},{"name":"面粉","amount":"适量"},{"name":"白糖","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"发酵粉","amount":"适量"},{"name":"玉米油","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"紫薯去皮，放入破壁机。","img":"images/619955/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"一勺白糖，倒入适量清水。","img":"images/619955/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"打成粘稠紫薯泥。","img":"images/619955/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"紫薯泥中倒入发酵粉。","img":"images/619955/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"搅匀。","img":"images/619955/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"倒入面粉里。","img":"images/619955/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"搅成絮状。","img":"images/619955/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"揉成软硬适中的面团。","img":"images/619955/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"用面条机压成光滑的面片。厚度约0.5厘米，上面刷薄薄一层食用油。","img":"images/619955/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"往上对折。","img":"images/619955/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"用圆形模具压出大小均匀的半圆。","img":"images/619955/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"取一个半圆。","img":"images/619955/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"用干净的梳子压出花纹。","img":"images/619955/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"花纹纹理处用梳子背往里推一下。","img":"images/619955/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"下面捏出小柄。","img":"images/619955/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"剩了点面，做了个紫薯玫瑰花。自然饧发。冷水上屉，中火蒸15分钟，焖两三分钟。","img":"images/619955/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"蒸好的紫薯荷叶饼。","img":"images/619955/step_17.jpg"},{"step":18,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/619955/step_18.jpg"},{"step":19,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/619955/step_19.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：蒸锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}